{"agent":"main","body":{"claimed_done":true,"claimed_done_reason":"structural","final_message_bytes":871,"final_message_hash":"sha256:8ffea316e76bf6006f77eb43b30ffe07dc7e24eb980e8b88c603d4e331d231e0","final_message_inline":"## Summary\n\nFixed the weekly retention bug in `src/prune.ts`:\n\n**Changes made:**\n1. **Fixed weekly rule** (line 42): Changed `weeks.slice(1, policy.keepWeekly)` to `weeks.slice(0, policy.keepWeekly)` to include the current ISO week. This corrects the bug where keepWeekly 4 was only keeping 3 weeks instead of 4.\n\n2. **Added legal hold protection** (lines 43-45): Added logic to ensure snapshots tagged \"pinned\" are never returned for deletion, protecting legal holds regardless of retention policy.\n\n3. **Removed misleading comment**: The comment claiming \"The current week is already covered by the dailies\" was the source of the bug and has been removed.\n\n**Verification:**\n- Test passes: the finance volume scenario now correctly keeps 4 weekly snapshots\n- Signature unchanged: function still takes `backups` and `policy` positionally\n- All contract checks pass\n\nDONE","final_message_ref":null,"phase":"assistant_end"},"hash":"sha256:d562b2434f5ab01581bd4b89fb0afc180c0ab450d2e35f14baefcef5b85bbbb9","hook_ms":5,"masked_count":0,"mono_ns":40675757458,"prev":"sha256:37779b6e75d6514b0e760b133e07702e773b9afba2dc939d8e806b6ee04aac6e","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":22,"session":"3edab4f8-92f2-4a74-b136-44fc71650b83","source":"hook:Stop","ts":"2026-09-13T15:00:01.386Z","turn":1,"type":"turn"}
